mAELDQ6SSncc0Ng/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxsDoDI81S8D80gCTfxzzC2tibJFM48cfkK4b7vk1l0X3Tiat7W2YJv2aw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><section><section><p><span><strong>田赛</strong></span></p></section></section></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxUboYafUicpt0ZN45lhGTbQHfVLrKkSibiaPp7fyfk97j57iaEs1AbwictYQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxdv0gx7E6xMic1zsNmkEeNFOEV2zs1wCReuqK9MM1AUAPvsRtsA5ibFjg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span>目光坚毅，脚步生风</span></p><p><span>腾空而起</span></p><p><span>跃出优美弧线</span></p><section><span>落地时扬起的沙土也为你庆祝</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxjQCByL6aPTswuq0Bb07foOC8apaYFa8t3jxicNyTN2LLNumv6hkpc5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMx5gLwoXYBiaKVJ42nhRib9wxV0ibOg3ictcrwlhH9xWAJDLOpGLOK6ksCQg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>离弦般的助跑</span></p><p><span>鼓点似的跨越</span></p><p><span>旋风般的腾空</span></p><p><span>起跳瞬间</span></p><p><span>划过空中的身影</span></p><p><span>是力与美的完美交织</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/k947icPboBqC6UfmsURRqml5r8codXBkpEejLqkBz7Yg3GZic8IloUmnxh83LABUMyhhfT8IuiagxwBf5L0zkKgyibBW6B5fFXlA/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>夺冠：</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>男子200米、400米冠军</strong></p><p><strong>电子工程学院（人工智能学院）</strong></p><p><strong>2023级本科生徐心诚</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section><section><section><p>•</p></section></section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMx5MkaCgVVHGZ1bvzhMibzzibYJ4JlgXptpiaMOh3b5iczECGZpxx63IPTKg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p></section><section><p><span>“相较于400米来说，200米是我的‘舒适圈’。”来自电子工程学院（人工智能学院）2023级的<span>校田径队队员</span>徐心诚，在本次校运会中<span>收获了</span>男子200米和400米两枚金牌。谈及此次双冠，徐心诚感到“惊喜又意外”。“是因为主力去参加锦标赛了，我才能侥幸得第一。”他谦虚地说。</span></p><p><span>徐心诚与田径结缘，是天赋使然。拥有跑步天赋<span>的</span>他从小在各种田径比赛中获奖。“越跑越有自信，越跑越想跑。”不仅如此，对他来说，跑步也是一种解压的方式，“跑步可以缓解压力，也确实给我带来了成就感。”接下来，他希望自己能努力提升成绩，争取在明年像师兄师姐们一样“为校出征”，参加大学生田径锦标赛。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section><section><section><p>•</p></section></section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>男子4x400米 冠军</strong></p><p><strong>工程学院本科生 </strong></p><p><strong>游康宇 温健宇 郭家铭 肖志明</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section><section><section><p>•</p></section></section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxmUvhlkxm6eCXr8xQyytMJo1albWGicCXXMiboAJtvNrCMoJXfl4Ge6RQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p></section><section><p><span>“我们赢了！”工程学院的游康宇、温健宇、郭家铭、肖志明在拿到男子4×400米接力赛冠军后兴奋地喊道，“今天终于把属于我们的冠军拿了回来！没有辜负前面的努力！”为了弥补昨天4x100米接力赛未夺冠的遗憾，四人抱着必胜的心态，在实力和完美的配合下，终于如愿以偿，勇摘桂冠。</span></p><p><span>这支夺冠的队由三名大一新生和一名大三老将组成，尽管磨合不久，但他们却对夺冠信心十足。“我们对自己的实力很自信，只要不失误，平稳的过渡，就能拿下冠军。”谈及对明年校运会的期望时，他们表示，“希望明年再接再厉，争取拿下两个冠军！”</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section><section><section><p>•</p></section></section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>女子跳远冠军</strong></p><p><strong>园艺学院2024级本科生陈立婷</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section><section><section><p>•</p></section></section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxHZSg4kEuTJE1SkAbWt4lKA6KqnTkkZETc5SKHSicdicMb2mu9vXMcI2g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p></section><section><p><span>当女子跳远项目尘埃落定，来自园艺学院的24级小将陈立婷以1cm的优势有惊无险地取得了冠军。“感觉这个冠军挺来之不易，所以开心翻倍！”她激动地说。作为非专业选手，她认为，是兴趣驱使她接触跳远这项运动。“我本身也很享受跳远腾空的感觉。”</span></p><p><span>据她回忆，在进行第三跳时，恰巧广播在播放为她加油的稿子。陈立婷表示，可能正是这种“奇妙的缘分”与朋友的鼓励让她跳出了自己的最好成绩。未来，她相信自己会带着顽强拼搏的体育精神越走越远，不只是在跳远的赛场，更是在人生的道路上。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section><section><section><p>•</p></section></section><section><section><section><p>✦</p></section></section></section></section><p><span>比赛的胜利</span></p><p><span>是运动员挥洒的汗水<br/></span></p><p><span>也离不开认真负责的工作人员<br/></span></p><p><span>呐喊助威的啦啦队员</span></p><p><span>每个人都是自己赛道的胜利者</span><br/></p><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxAZ0aBMicCRoOTVmYWLqgtFfyD8zibSpy5FPZhM2ARW9mDVMia2sUbMCicA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxDzEYzajq0SfkIKzEkZya0iabb9ibpj2oUBdDxibB3gtVNTCh9CPdUian5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxIeVvFAHvN3ySuJoLZBdXvicfJibN8js0sk0sDLSYXRKmt2pyj3ywydCQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMx76758rsY7PNWrko74hX75VVG0PSeVx16YGFtmaGY3HcByZcvILXSSA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcic3vrqWwAX9iaiaAiblzwaJZMxhwZGlyw5bcBhYiaD2HBtaJSTx9ibhq9SLknticb2NmlW9hqjs5EAjAUkQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>体育精神</span></p><p><span>不在于一场比赛的胜负</span></p><p><span>所以</span></p><p><span>今天的冠军属于<br/></span></p><p><span>每一个不言放弃</span></p><section><span>超越自己的华农健儿！</span></section><p><span>生命不止，运动不息</span></p><p><span>华农健儿将会延续</span></p><p><span>在赛场上的拼搏精神</span></p><p><span>踔厉奋发，永不止步</span></p><p><span>让我们，明年再会！</span></p><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fqBCmibkvpEdyIpniakVDIibbIEc1euA007C8su9TiaTZicvAPXoNyfYe7fkNyA3BwOjl5y9yzeup8pA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></p></section><section><section><section><strong>▶ 往期回顾</strong></section></s